ts to a name (artist, band, movie name) that change its meaning and results in a humorous name), Orca performs much worse that ChatGPT, potentially due to lack of sufficient knowledge about sports, artists, bands, movies and also usage of humor in English language. \u2022 On the other hand, it performs significantly better than ChatGPT and marginally lower to GPT-4 in the movie recommendation task (given a list of movies, recommend a relevant movie from a list of movie choices)", "type": "Document"}}